      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "login route sends the nonce as `state` and sets it in a cookie\n(HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Path=/auth, 10 min, cleared when the\ncallback is checked). It binds the callback to the browser that started\nthe flow (login CSRF, ADR-0007).",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "login route sends the nonce as `state` and sets it in a cookie\n(HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Path=/auth, 10 min, cleared when the\ncallback is checked). It binds the callback to the browser that started\nthe flow (login CSRF, ADR-0007).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10.66
    },
    {
      "id": "a5ea3fac278540829",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 491.4,
      "height": 70.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 1983103148,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1422788295,
      "index": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Linking by email only when the provider vouches it is verified;\nlinking revokes the local password (ADR-0007). The JWT never\nappears in a URL: the code does, single-use and 60 s.\nUnknown, used and expired codes all answer the same 401.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Linking by email only when the provider vouches it is verified;\nlinking revokes the local password (ADR-0007). The JWT never\nappears in a URL: the code does, single-use and 60 s.\nUnknown, used and expired codes all answer the same 401.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10.66
    },
    {
      "id": "993d419c6d8d460e9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 436.8,
      "height": 70.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 95299135,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1957630981,
      "index": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Any callback failure is a 302 to the SPA, never JSON:\n?error=cancelled (consent declined), email_unverified\n(no verified email), failed (bad state, anything else).\nReferrer-Policy: no-referrer on every callback redirect.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Any callback failure is a 302 to the SPA, never JSON:\n?error=cancelled (consent declined), email_unverified\n(no verified email), failed (bad state, anything else).\nReferrer-Policy: no-referrer on every callback redirect.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10.66
    }
